./working_notes/claim_ledger.md:48:Evidence: Let \(V_T=\sup_a\mathbb E\sum_t r_t(a)\), \(V_T^H=\sup_a\mathbb E\sum_t r_t^H(a)\), and \(\delta_T(H)=V_T-V_T^H\). Since learner reward only increases when moving from truncated to true rewards,
