./logs/iter_006_idea_01_explorer_01.stderr.log:1222:Facts: Every learner has regret at least \(qD/8\) on one of the two worlds. With absorbing extension, \(\beta(h)=q\) for \(h<D\) and \(0\) for \(h\ge D\). For integer \(H<D\),
