./logs/iter_002_synthesis.stderr.log:7457:-Failure: False under law-aware/process-wise quantifiers. For iid uniform prices, \(\beta(h)=1\) for all \(h\), but a learner knowing the law can play the best fixed quote in expectation and get zero regret.
