./logs/iter_006_idea_02_explorer_01.stdout.log:71:This is a deterministic, no-estimation, singleton-law obstruction to any theorem saying raw \(\beta(h)\to0\) is necessary for sublinear regret. The obstruction is specifically that raw hitting delay ignores payoff scale.
