./logs/iter_002_idea_01_explorer_01.stderr.log:2797:./logs/iter_001_synthesis.stderr.log:2016:+Why it matters: If the law is known, playing a maximizer of \(G_T(a)=\sum_{L=0}^{T-1}a(1-a^L)\) every round matches the fixed comparator in expectation, giving zero regret despite failed \(\beta\).
